cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this template in your work or teaching, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Smart Study AI: Claude Prompt Template for Medical Students"
abstract: >
  An open-source, configurable Claude AI prompt template for medical
  students. Designed to support structured learning, clinical reasoning,
  and exam preparation using AI assistance with the student's own study
  materials. The template is subject-agnostic and includes shortcut
  commands (/flashcards, /quiz, /summary, /compare, /case, /explain,
  /highyield).
